abstract: >-
  Sparse CSC Python solver for balanced AC power system load flow, PV generator
  reactive-limit switching, automated N-1 contingency security screening, and
  saddle-node bifurcation P-V voltage stability analysis, validated against
  MATPOWER case14 and case_ieee30 benchmarks.
